MATLAB implementations of block-structured adaptive FAS multigrid.
The numerical method is described by Feng, Guo, Lowengrub and Wise,
Journal of Computational Physics 352 (2018), 463-497.

The starfish geometry, parameters, and forcing follow Calvin1127XD/
DiffuseDomainHelmholtz at commit a9d8449005f4ab030e64cf4c346c7225998fa01e.
The distance evaluator, transmission adapter, and gallery are new here.
See provenance/README.md for source and packaging details.
